("A033","YES","OBJECT_LEVEL","TWO_SAME_ROLE","YES","ABSENT","NA","NO","HANDLER",1,"A033/diff.patch:1-26 (fix unrelated to addressId; only POST method check)","Advisory: authenticated user of one account views another account's addresses via addressId. Shown diff only adds a POST-method check in a comment resource command, so the fix does not match the advisory."),
("A034","YES","MISSING_AUTHENTICATION","NONE","YES","ABSENT","NA","NO","MIDDLEWARE_FILTER",2,"A034/diff.patch:src/mcp/server.go startSSE; src/mcp/sse_security.go","Separate MCP SSE listener dispatched tool calls with no Host, Origin or secret check; any caller (a browser via DNS rebinding) could invoke tools anonymously. REST swagger does not cover MCP."),
("A035","YES","MISSING_AUTHENTICATION","NONE","YES","ABSENT","NA","NO","MIDDLEWARE_FILTER",3,"A035/diff.patch:pkg/router/v1/v1api.go (route moved WhiteScope to AuthScope)","GET /clusters/kubeconfig/{name} was registered in the unauthenticated scope; anonymous callers could download cluster kubeconfig. Route moved to authenticated scope."),
("A036","YES","FUNCTION_LEVEL","ONE","YES","PRESENT","DECLARED","NO","OTHER",2,"A036/diff.patch:internal/migrations/init.go:273, v9.go; contract docs/swagger.json:~1670","Default reputation threshold for accepting answers was 1, so a user with minimal rank could mark an answer (their own) as accepted; fix sets -1 via config migration. Accept rule not stated in contract."),
("A037","YES","PROPERTY_LEVEL","ONE","YES","PRESENT","NOT_DECLARED","NO","SERVICE_LOGIC",3,"A037/diff.patch:user_service.go UpdateUser; user_manager.go validateAdminModifications; contract v0_swagger.json:1370 PUT /user/{id}","Non-admin user sends PUT on own user with IsAdmin true and becomes admin. Fix blocks non-admins from changing admin-controlled fields."),
("A038","YES","PROPERTY_LEVEL","ONE","YES","UNCLEAR","NA","NO","SERVICE_LOGIC",2,"A038/diff.patch:workflow/util/merge.go ValidateUserOverrides, artifactGCOverrideViolations; contract truncated at 3000 lines","A user submitting a workflow under Strict/Secure template referencing could set ArtifactGC.PodSpecPatch/ServiceAccountName/PodMetadata, bypassing the field allow-list. Submit endpoint not visible in truncated contract."),
("A039","YES","OBJECT_LEVEL","TWO_ROLES","YES","PRESENT","DECLARED","NO","DATA_QUERY",2,"A039/diff.patch:pkg/models/project_access.go projectAccessQuery; contract pkg__swagger__swagger.json:2321 /projects/{id}","A user explicitly shared read-only on a child project received the higher permission inherited from a parent, so could modify, delete or re-share. Needs owner and restricted user. Contract states no inheritance rule."),
("A040","YES","TENANT_ISOLATION","ONE","YES","PRESENT","NOT_DECLARED","NO","SERVICE_LOGIC",2,"A040/diff.patch:server/application/application.go getAppEnforceRBAC; contract assets/swagger.json:1164 /applications/{name}/resource","API server did not check that an Application's namespace is permitted by its project's sourceNamespaces, so a user could act through RBAC of a project the app should not belong to. Rule absent from contract."),
("A041","YES","MISSING_AUTHENTICATION","NONE","YES","ABSENT","NA","NO","SERVICE_LOGIC",3,"A041/diff.patch:server/mdm/android/service/pubsub.go handlePubSubStatusReport","Android Pub/Sub push endpoint processed status reports (including deletion/unenrol events) before authenticating the token; anonymous request could unenrol a device. Endpoint not in provided contracts."),
("A042","YES","TENANT_ISOLATION","TWO_SAME_ROLE","YES","ABSENT","NA","NO","DATA_QUERY",2,"A042/diff.patch:backend/src/cache/server/mutation.go, model/execution_cache.go","Execution cache key ignored namespace, so a tenant's step could receive or poison another tenant's cached outputs; fix adds namespace to key and lookup. Effect seen via later run outputs; webhook not in contract."),
