("A044","YES","FUNCTION_LEVEL","TWO_ROLES","YES","ABSENT","NA","NO","SERVICE_LOGIC",3,"A044/diff.patch:server/channels/app/team.go:511 UpdateTeamMemberSchemeRoles","A team admin could set scheme-admin on a guest team member via role update, promoting guests to team admin. Fix rejects updates on guests and guest+admin. Only boards contract supplied."),
("A045","YES","TENANT_ISOLATION","ONE","YES","ABSENT","NA","NO","SERVICE_LOGIC",2,"A045/diff.patch:object/token_oauth.go parseAndValidateSubjectToken","Token-exchange grant accepted a subject token from a user in another organization for the target application, giving cross-organization privilege. Fix validates with issuing app certificate and audience. Token endpoint not in contract."),
